  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "291c45d1955969b5",
      "translationZh": "Optimum 现已支持推理，并支持 Hugging Face Transformers 流水线，包括使用 ONNX Runtime 进行文本生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f9f5155cb65368db",
      "translationZh": "BERT 和 Transformers 的应用持续增长。基于 Transformer 的模型如今不仅在自然语言处理领域取得了最先进的性能，在计算机视觉、语音和时间序列领域也同样如此。💬 🖼 🎤 ⏳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95b9b9a1de5fb42d",
      "translationZh": "企业如今正从实验和研究阶段迈向生产阶段，以便将 Transformer 模型用于大规模工作负载。但在默认情况下，与传统机器学习算法相比，BERT 及其同类模型速度相对较慢、体积较大，而且结构复杂。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb09693d83b729fc",
      "translationZh": "为解决这一挑战，我们创建了 Optimum——Hugging Face Transformers 的一个扩展，用于加速 BERT 等 Transformer 模型的训练和推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d591780220ceb249",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客文章中，你将了解：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "91a945109a48a74d",
      "translationZh": "1. 什么是 Optimum？用五岁孩子也能懂的方式解释",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e7d6ff1900dbb7dc",
      "translationZh": "2. Optimum 新增的推理和流水线功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b9a6ea7d8b12868",
      "translationZh": "3. 加速 RoBERTa 问答任务的端到端教程，包括量化和优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8d59cc27ac03eb81",
      "translationZh": "4. 当前局限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e96c128e815d9612",
      "translationZh": "5. Optimum 推理常见问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9b213c5a56d3a862",
      "translationZh": "6. 接下来有什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3109eb1e1e6cd28",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧！🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91a945109a48a74d",
      "translationZh": "1. 什么是 Optimum？用五岁孩子也能懂的方式解释",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd27584f0227bdcf",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Optimum 是一个开源库，也是 Hugging Face Transformers 的扩展，它为性能优化工具提供统一的 API，以便在加速硬件上以最高效率训练和运行模型，其中包括用于优化 Graphcore IPU 和 Habana Gaudi 性能的工具包。Optimum 可用于加速训练、量化、计算图优化，现在还支持通过 transformers 流水线进行推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e7d6ff1900dbb7dc",
      "translationZh": "2. Optimum 新增的推理和流水线功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fef32f17a4e2d74f",
      "translationZh": "随着 Optimum 1.2 的发布，我们新增了对推理和 transformers 流水线的支持。这使 Optimum 用户能够沿用他们在 transformers 中熟悉的 API，同时享受 ONNX Runtime 等加速运行时带来的性能优势。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd5c27f1b946c671",
      "translationZh": "从 Transformers 切换到 Optimum Inference。Optimum Inference 模型在 API 层面与 Hugging Face Transformers 模型兼容。这意味着你只需将 AutoModelForXxx 类替换为 Optimum 中对应的 ORTModelForXxx 类。例如，下面展示了如何在 Optimum 中使用问答模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1aa3664fa6f49986",
      "translationZh": "在首个版本中，我们加入了对 ONNX Runtime 的支持，但后续还会有更多功能！这些新的 ORTModelForXX 现在可以与 transformers 流水线配合使用。它们还完全集成到了 Hugging Face Hub 中，可以向社区推送优化后的检查点，也可以从社区拉取这些检查点。此外，你可以使用 ORTQuantizer 和 ORTOptimizer，先对模型进行量化和优化，然后再运行推理。更多详情，请参阅包含量化和优化的 RoBERTa 问答加速端到端教程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b9a6ea7d8b12868",
      "translationZh": "3. 包含量化和优化的 RoBERTa 问答加速端到端教程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29fee10236501a57",
      "translationZh": "在这篇 RoBERTa 问答加速端到端教程中，你将学习如何：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c5dff9225cf7808",
      "translationZh": "安装适用于 ONNX Runtime 的 Optimum",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d108806a62a4db69",
      "translationZh": "将 Hugging Face Transformers 模型转换为 ONNX 格式以进行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "208a718807955695",
      "translationZh": "使用 ORTOptimizer 优化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6fb63efd697abb3c",
      "translationZh": "使用 ORTQuantizer 应用动态量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78ac421815c58935",
      "translationZh": "使用 Transformers 流水线运行加速推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed8257eea4a080f0",
      "translationZh": "评估性能和速度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a420bddaa3f4107a",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cef626eab3dcc4d",
      "translationZh": "本教程是在 m5.xlarge AWS EC2 实例上创建并运行的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8b4e8b0868dab42",
      "translationZh": "3.1 安装适用于 Onnxruntime 的 Optimum",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6dab9e769f7b05ed",
      "translationZh": "我们的第一步是安装带有 onnxruntime 实用工具的 Optimum。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42a1469610cadcc4",
      "translationZh": "这会为我们安装所有必需的包，包括 transformers、torch 和 onnxruntime。如果你打算使用 GPU，可以通过 pip install optimum[onnxruntime-gpu] 安装 optimum。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1e9a8e8d2c1e09d0",
      "translationZh": "3.2 将 Hugging Face Transformers 模型转换为 ONNX 以进行推理**",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7ac19ac8d10361c",
      "translationZh": "在开始优化之前，我们需要将原始的 transformers 模型转换为 onnx 格式。为此，我们将使用新的 ORTModelForQuestionAnswering 类，调用 from_pretrained() 方法，并设置 from_transformers 属性。我们使用的模型是 deepset/roberta-base-squad2，这是一个在 SQUAD2 数据集上微调的 RoBERTa 模型，F1 分数达到 82.91，其功能（任务）为 question-answering。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "293debabd47b5123",
      "translationZh": "我们已成功将原始的 transformers 模型转换为 onnx，并通过 transformers.pipelines 使用该模型运行了第一次预测。现在，让我们来优化它。🏎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da4b079888dced5a",
      "translationZh": "如果你想进一步了解如何导出 transformers 模型，请查看文档：导出 🤗 Transformers 模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b436a8a15b8a905",
      "translationZh": "3.3 使用 ORTOptimizer 优化模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5400c7b4d6a3dda0",
      "translationZh": "将 onnx 检查点保存到 onnx/ 后，我们现在可以使用 ORTOptimizer 应用算子融合、常量折叠等图优化，以降低延迟并加快推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3905f449ff32229",
      "translationZh": "为了测试性能，我们可以再次使用 ORTModelForQuestionAnswering 类，并提供额外的 file_name 参数来加载优化后的模型。（这也适用于 hub 上可用的模型。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eb2c781e0a386ff8",
      "translationZh": "我们将在步骤 3.6“评估性能和速度”中详细评估性能变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5800988e82eee034",
      "translationZh": "3.4 使用 ORTQuantizer 应用动态量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a14f7f09d170cdc8",
      "translationZh": "优化模型之后，我们还可以使用 ORTQuantizer 对其进行量化，进一步加速。ORTOptimizer 可用于应用动态量化，以减小模型大小、降低延迟并加速推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec8e10335a184a62",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 avx512_vnni，因为该实例搭载了支持 avx512 的 intel cascade-lake CPU。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf42c96c17d5fbef",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以比较这个模型的大小以及一些延迟性能指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1d97e0533f4e8af",
      "translationZh": "我们将模型大小从 473MB 减小到 291MB，降幅接近 50%。要运行推理，我们可以再次使用 ORTModelForQuestionAnswering 类，并提供额外的 file_name 参数来加载量化后的模型。（这也适用于 hub 上提供的模型。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da368ba75a4ff987",
      "translationZh": "太棒了！模型预测出了相同的答案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bdc8491eb2db7ff6",
      "translationZh": "3.5 使用 Transformers 流水线运行加速推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04a7e88eea59c620",
      "translationZh": "Optimum 内置了对 transformers 流水线的支持。这让我们可以使用在使用 PyTorch 和 TensorFlow 模型时已经熟悉的同一套 API。我们已在步骤 3.2,3.3 & 3.4 中使用此功能，测试转换和优化后的模型。在撰写本文时，我们支持 ONNX Runtime，未来还会支持更多。下方提供了一个使用 transformers 流水线的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f3ffc6706d5f928c",
      "translationZh": "除此之外，我们还为 Optimum 添加了一个 pipelines API，为你的加速模型提供更多安全保障。这意味着，如果你尝试通过 optimum.pipelines 使用不受支持的模型或任务，就会看到一条错误提示。你可以使用 optimum.pipelines 替代 transformers.pipelines。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5b990b4dd880053",
      "translationZh": "3.6 评估性能和速度",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76239ac9616b107d",
      "translationZh": "在这个加速 RoBERTa 问答模型的端到端教程中，我们进行了量化和优化，创建了 3 个不同的模型：一个未经优化的转换模型、一个经过优化的模型，以及一个经过量化的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2179a3d8711c0b03",
      "translationZh": "作为本教程的最后一步，我们希望详细了解模型的性能和准确率。应用图优化或量化等优化技术，不仅会影响性能（延迟），还可能影响模型的准确率。因此，加速模型需要进行权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "64c0d907772a63c1",
      "translationZh": "让我们评估这些模型。我们的 transformers 模型 deepset/roberta-base-squad2 是在 SQUAD2 数据集上微调的。我们将使用这个数据集来评估模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a57c51d14076517b",
      "translationZh": "现在，我们可以利用 datasets 的 map 函数遍历 squad 2 的验证集，并对每个数据点进行预测。为此，我们编写了一个 evaluate 辅助方法，它使用我们的 pipelines，并应用一些转换，以便与 squad v2 指标配合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab209a9b1234015c",
      "translationZh": "这可能需要相当长的时间（1.5h）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93e554a478c418fd",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们比较结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0b60b28e7cb67a0",
      "translationZh": "我们的优化并量化后的模型达到了 78.75% 的完全匹配率和 81.83% 的 f1 分数，相当于原始准确率的 99.61%。能够达到原始模型准确率的 99% 是非常好的结果，尤其是考虑到我们使用的是动态量化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0652f2e5041d1e2",
      "translationZh": "好了，让我们测试一下经过优化和量化的模型的性能（延迟）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ddae1e14abbbd3f",
      "translationZh": "不过，首先让我们将上下文和问题扩展到更有意义的序列长度 128。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a57fb8086646e297",
      "translationZh": "为简单起见，我们将使用一个 python 循环，计算原始模型以及经过优化和量化的模型的平均延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6435eb6c0ce5d9b6",
      "translationZh": "我们成功将模型的延迟从 117.61ms 降至 64.94ms，也就是实现了大约 2x 的加速，同时保留了 99.61% 的准确率。需要注意的是，我们使用的是一个性能中等、具有 2 个物理核心的 CPU 实例。通过切换到 GPU 或性能更高的 CPU 实例，例如采用 ice-lake 的实例，你可以将延迟降低到几毫秒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d59cc27ac03eb81",
      "translationZh": "4. 当前的局限性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c14cf68a47578fe",
      "translationZh": "我们刚刚开始在 https://github.com/huggingface/optimum 中支持推理，因此也想分享一下目前的局限性。所有这些限制都已纳入路线图，并将在不久的将来得到解决。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7080084100abda2",
      "translationZh": "远程模型 > 2GB：目前，只能从 Hugging Face Hub 加载小于 2GB 的模型。我们正在努力添加对 > 2GB 的模型 / 多文件模型的支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbdf6c7b094d34fa",
      "translationZh": "Seq2Seq 任务/模型：我们尚不支持 seq2seq 任务（如摘要生成）以及 T5 等模型，主要原因是目前仅支持单个模型这一限制。不过，我们正在积极努力解决这个问题，以便为你提供与 transformers 中你所熟悉的相同体验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f8b96f35816abdbc",
      "translationZh": "历史键值：像 GPT-2 这样的生成模型会使用一种称为历史键值的机制，这些键值是注意力模块中预先计算好的键值对，可用于加速解码。目前，ORTModelForCausalLM 尚未使用历史键值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "546bd08600c2a5d2",
      "translationZh": "无缓存：目前，加载优化后的模型 (*.onnx) 时，该模型不会被缓存在本地。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e96c128e815d9612",
      "translationZh": "5. Optimum 推理常见问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7674cceda5d76bdd",
      "translationZh": "支持哪些任务？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "961e42c488320b30",
      "translationZh": "你可以在文档中找到所有受支持任务的列表。目前支持的 pipelines 任务有 feature-extraction、text-classification、token-classification、question-answering、zero-shot-classification、text-generation。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbc73d28d646a9f1",
      "translationZh": "支持哪些模型？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b700799d3248ea59",
      "translationZh": "任何能够通过 transformers.onnx 导出且具有受支持任务的模型都可以使用，包括但不限于 BERT、ALBERT、GPT2、RoBERTa、XLM-RoBERTa、DistilBERT ....",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56dda12409449389",
      "translationZh": "支持哪些运行时？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04ff42126e9107ef",
      "translationZh": "目前支持 ONNX Runtime。我们正在努力在未来添加更多运行时支持。如果你对某个特定运行时感兴趣，请告诉我们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1712e05e66b23f8f",
      "translationZh": "如何将 Optimum 与 Transformers 一起使用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f3b533a34ec30f8",
      "translationZh": "你可以在我们的文档中找到示例和说明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ad34704d46f0560",
      "translationZh": "如何使用 GPU？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "41e9572b4d8fa5d3",
      "translationZh": "要使用 GPU，你只需安装 optimum[onnxruntine-gpu]，它会安装所需的 GPU 执行提供程序，并默认使用它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4b5095731aa529e",
      "translationZh": "如何在流水线中使用经过量化和优化的模型？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "620247937d039d15",
      "translationZh": "你可以使用新的 ORTModelForXXX 类，通过 from_pretrained 方法加载经过优化或量化的模型。你可以在我们的文档中了解更多相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9b213c5a56d3a862",
      "translationZh": "6. 接下来是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "870dd451df366383",
      "translationZh": "你问 Optimum 接下来有什么计划？有很多。我们正致力于让 Optimum 成为对 transformers 进行加速和优化的标杆开源工具包。为了实现这一目标，我们将解决当前的局限，改进文档，创建更多内容和示例，并不断突破 transformers 加速与优化的极限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db84682fcfd55029",
      "translationZh": "针对当前的局限，Optimum 路线图上的一些重要功能包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4c9ae5f99f82c09",
      "translationZh": "支持语音模型（Wav2vec2）和语音任务（自动语音识别）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "69680b8399a4ed29",
      "translationZh": "支持视觉模型（ViT）和视觉任务（图像分类）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4325c27abb4aecf",
      "translationZh": "通过添加对 OrtValue 和 IOBinding 的支持来提高性能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa9eff98250b5c40",
      "translationZh": "提供更便捷的方式来评估加速后的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da10c13223f1d9d6",
      "translationZh": "添加对其他运行时和执行提供程序的支持，例如 TensorRT 和 AWS-Neuron",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67ae6121f5e51fe6",
      "translationZh": "感谢阅读！如果你和我一样，对加速 Transformers、提高它们的效率并将它们扩展到能够处理数十亿次请求感到兴奋，那就来应聘吧，我们正在招聘。🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f7c235e00eae61c",
      "translationZh": "如果你有任何问题，欢迎通过 Github 或在论坛上联系我。你也可以在 Twitter 或 LinkedIn 上与我建立联系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
